        "elementor-widget-text-editor"
      ],
      "heading": null,
      "bodyHtml": "<p>The industrial magnetic sensors from Jaxicloud Fleet Management Innovation are ideal for detecting the opening of truck doors:</p><p>100% independent</p><p>Their battery-powered operation provides up to 14 years of autonomy, ensuring competitive total cost of ownership.</p><p>Compatible with telematics boxes</p><p>Equipped with&nbsp;Bluetooth Low Energy technology,&nbsp;these sensors are compatible with most built-in telematics boxes on the market and require no additional integration.</p><p>Quick and easy to install</p><p>Easy to install thanks to the different attachment methods (high-performance double-sided sticker or screw-on support), these sensors can&nbsp;be attached to any type of surface&nbsp;and require no wiring.</p><p>Industrial boxes</p><p>These sensors are rugged and waterproof and are designed to be used in extreme conditions. They are therefore&nbsp;waterproof and resistant to shock and vibration.</p>",
      "bodyText": "The industrial magnetic sensors from Jaxicloud Fleet Management Innovation are ideal for detecting the opening of truck doors:100% independentTheir battery-powered operation provides up to 14 years of autonomy, ensuring competitive total cost of ownership.Compatible with telematics boxesEquipped with Bluetooth Low Energy technology, these sensors are compatible with most built-in telematics boxes on the market and require no additional integration.Quick and easy to installEasy to install thanks to the different attachment methods (high-performance double-sided sticker or screw-on support), these sensors can be attached to any type of surface and require no wiring.Industrial boxesThese sensors are rugged and waterproof and are designed to be used in extreme conditions. They are therefore waterproof and resistant to shock and vibration.",
